{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <final id=\"a\">\n    <onentry>\n      <log label=\"finished\" expr=\"\"/>\n    </onentry>\n  </final>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml042-empty-expression.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml042-empty-expression.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":8,"byteOffset":155,"endColumn":36,"endLine":4,"startColumn":28,"startLine":4},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the empty `expr`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml042-empty-expression.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":36,"endLine":4,"startColumn":29,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"empty `expr` on `<log>` is treated as absent\n\n**Note:** a blank `expr` logs no value, exactly as if `expr` were absent\n\n**Help:** write the intended expression, or remove the attribute\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.10 Errors\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions","text":"empty `expr` on `<log>` is treated as absent"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":163,"start":156},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"SCXML042"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"a blank `<log expr>` is treated as absent (the log has no value), while every other empty expression attribute, including `<transition cond>`, is still evaluated as an invalid expression and raises `error.execution` (a condition is then false); either way the empty value is almost always a mistake"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: write the intended expression, or remove the attribute.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML042` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#expressions","id":"SCXML042","name":"SCXML042","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an expression attribute is present but empty"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}